
cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the archived
  software release using its DOI.

type: software

title: "CAJO Edge AI Reproducibility Repository"

abstract: >-
  Research code, experiment configurations, deployment
  measurements, and supporting results for constraint-aware
  Edge AI configuration assessment across CIFAR-10,
  CIFAR-100, and Speech Commands. The experiments examine
  architecture selection, pruning, knowledge distillation,
  INT8 quantization, and accuracy-storage-latency trade-offs.

authors:
  - family-names: Rokaya
    given-names: Mahmoud

license: CC-BY-4.0

version: 1.0.0

keywords:
  - Edge AI
  - constraint-aware configuration selection
  - model compression
  - pruning
  - knowledge distillation
  - quantization
  - reproducibility
  - CIFAR-10
  - CIFAR-100
  - Speech Commands

